  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In first experiment, <br/><br/>24 g of iron oxide gave 1.68 g of iron.<br/><br/>Mass of iron oxide  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn></math>  g<br/><br/>Mass of iron  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1.68</mn></math>  g<br/><br/>Mass of oxygen  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1.68</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.72</mn></math> <br/><br/>Ratio of masses of iron and oxygen  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.68</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.72</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br/><br/>In second experiment,<br/><br/>Mass of iron oxide  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2.9</mn></math>  g<br/><br/>Mass of iron  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2.09</mn></math>  g<br/><br/>Mass of oxygen  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2.9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2.09</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.81</mn></math> <br/><br/>Ratio of masses of iron and oxygen  <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.09</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.81</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
